msgid ""
"Congratulations! You escaped the Kraylor clutches and returned all your "
"gathered data on the Kraylor to the Human Navy."
msgstr "Congratulations! You escaped the Kraylor clutches and returned all your gathered data on the Kraylor to the Human Navy."

